1kqi|v|To cover or overlay with gold, silver, or other metals, either by a mechanical process, as hammering, or by a chemical process, as electrotyping. ; To cover or overlay with plates of metal; to arm with metal for defense. ; To adorn with plated metal; as, a plated harness. ; To beat into thin, flat pieces, or laminae. ; To calender; as, to plate paper.	s:1iie,21,2~1iie,21,2
